# AI-Assistant — overview (always on)

EMR-assisted + AI-voice-assisted **PDF completion of the Ohio Medicaid ODM 07216**
form. PDF-flow only — no browser automation, no portal submission, Person 1 only.

**Stack:** FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2.0 (sync) + Pydantic v2 (backend) · Next.js 14 +
React 18 + TypeScript (frontend) · PostgreSQL · LangChain/**OpenAI** with a
deterministic rule-based fallback · PyMuPDF.

